=============================================================================
(Taareekh: 2026-10-08 — Office wave 2 ke kaam ke sath)

1) AI SE LIVE "RESEARCH" (taareekhi chhutiyan / hadsay / embassy band)
   - Aap ne kaha tha ke dates teh kerte waqt AI model research kery k us din
     Pakistan/Islamabad/Quetta men koi chhutti, hadsy ya tayyari ki waja sy bandi
     to nahi thi, aur embassies band to nahi thin.
   - Live AI "research" app ke andar har date per chalana reliable nahi (AI ke
     jawab har bar badal sakty hen, aur 2019-2022 ke rozana hadsaat ka verified
     record kisi API men mojod nahi). Is liye ye tareeqa banaya gaya hai:
       * Admin-editable "Holidays / Band din" table (scope: PAKISTAN, ISLAMABAD,
         QUETTA, GUJRAT, LAHORE, EMBASSIES_ISB, SAUDI) — admin kisi b date ko
         kisi b city ke liye band mark ker sakta hai (hadsa/embassy band waghera).
       * Date engine in tables + weekends (Pakistan: Sat/Sun, Saudi: Fri/Sat) se
         100% deterministic dates nikalta hai — galti ki sorat men admin date
         edit ker ke dobara "Dates generate karein" dabwa sakta hai.
       * Expected printing date ke liye pehly sy mojod AI working-day helper
         (bot provider wala) wesy hi kaam kerta rahy ga.

2) ISLAMIC (HIJRI) DATE — Saud MBC
   - Saud MBC ki date ke sath Islamic date b show hoti hai, lakin ye tabular
     (civil) calendar sy calculate hoti hai jo chand dekhny wali asal tareekh sy
     ±1 din farq ho sakta hai. Print kerany sy pehly aik dafa verify ker lena.
   - Saudi Arabia ki working dates b isi hisab sy hain.

3) EID WALI SEED DATES
   - 2019-2026 ki Eid-ul-Fitr / Eid-ul-Adha / Eid Milad ki seed dates approximate
     Gregorian dates hain (reason men likha hai). Admin unhen asal elan k mutabiq
     edit ker sakta hai (Holidays panel).

4) DNS / VERCEL DOMAINS
   - Department access links siraf system men record hote hen (Setup → Department
     Links). DNS records Vercel men khud manually add kerne hon gy — ye aap ne
     khud kaha tha, is liye code men kuchh nahi kiya gaya.

5) REAL DATABASE PER TEST
   - Is environment men koi real PostgreSQL database nahi tha. Migration SQL
     (prisma/migrations/20261008120000_office_wave2) hand-written aur idempotent
     hai, prisma validate + poora typecheck pass hai, LAKIN live DB per run nahi
     hua. Deploy ke baad zaroor:
       1. npx prisma migrate deploy
       2. npm run db:seed:office     (categories, sets, holidays seed)
       3. 2019 pool men 30 working dates add karein (Setup → 2019 Working Dates
          Pool → "Suggest dates" se aik click men)
       4. Aik test case bana ker poora flow (payment → filing → printing → atta
          → courier) chala kar dekh lein.

6) R-NUMBER 19/20/21 KI SORAT MEN MONTH/DAY
   - Aap ke instructions men siraf YEAR teh tha (19→2020, 20→2021, 21→2022).
     Month/day ke liye system first payment ki month/day use kerta hai us year men
     (phir first working day). Ager aap ka matlab kuchh aur tha to bataein, aik
     line ka change hai.

7) REMARK "SEEN" FLAG DEPARTMENT-LEVEL HAI
   - Jab kisi department ka aik user remark "seen" mark kerta hai to usi
     department ke baqi users ke liye b seen ho jata hai (schema target-based hai,
     per-user nahi). Per-user seen chahiye to schema change chahiye hoga.

